<title>PORTUGAL: Jeronimo Martins boosts profit 43 pct.</title>
<headline>Jeronimo Martins boosts profit 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending Dec 31</p>
<p>(In billion escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    11.617   vs    8.122</p>
<p>    Attributable net profit    7.047   vs    5.556</p>
<p>    Profit per share     257 escudos   vs    210</p>
<p>Note - Estabelecimentos Jeronimo Martins &amp; Filhos is full company name.  </p>
<p>    Sales			  359.789   vs  281.665</p>
<p>    Amortisation of goodwill   2.900   vs    2.397</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    18.404   vs   13.011</p>
<p>    Net interest payments	4.555   vs    4.565</p>
<p>    Extraordinary losses	 0.308   vs    0.036</p>
<p>    Tax				2.722   vs    1.279</p>
<p>    Minority interests	   4.570   vs    2.566</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
